    "text": {
     "en": "A mela is crowded. We must stay safe.\nHold the hand of an elder and stay close. Nita held Dadiji's hand on the road.\nWalk carefully and keep an eye on vehicles moving in both directions.\nAgree on a meeting place in case you get separated.\nIf you get lost, stay in one place and ask a police person or a shopkeeper for help. Do not go with a stranger.\nKnow your parent's phone number."
    }
